{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7414054561448463384","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/98a8408f88692df14501ec1774ea0ef3~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164594&x-signature=IOsEeO9Ct9aqnwkKMFO18ILp9fM%3D","duration":5917,"title":"卖菜大妈竟是皇嫂","video_desc":"刘桂花二十年前救了五皇子，却失去儿子志洲。五皇子登基后寻她，此时刘桂花因保护女儿与李家发生冲突，皇上为她伸张了正义。刘桂花找到志洲，可志洲已经失去了理智，被困在了白家。刘桂花展现出非凡勇气，揭露了白家背后的丑陋秘密，再次赢得了皇上的支持。宁王叛乱，志洲为保护母亲恢复神智，还在偶然间习得了高超武艺，最终成为辅佐皇上平定叛乱的重要力量。","series_id":"7414025295927184446","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623563272D32AF8F253A6AC3C1A\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7414025295927184446\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.04639548063278198,\\\"like\\\":0.05665243789553642,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.563684344291687,\\\"collect\\\":0.03514484688639641,\\\"finish\\\":0.0028009277302771807,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7818489074707031,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.13323712348937988}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7414025295927184446","play_cnt":89283,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"顶好剧场","sub_title":"古装·治愈","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":91,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5116,\"name\":\"治愈\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categor