,"title":"三秋迟暮，候鸟无栖","video_desc":"宋景行因弟弟身染重病，无奈代弟嫁入将军府，只为求药救弟。谁料妻子叶轻眉在新婚不久，便弃他而去，与白月光私奔。三年转瞬即逝，叶轻眉竟携白月光大摇大摆归京，还妄图休夫。看到宋景行育有幼子，叶轻眉恼羞成怒，勾结他人对其恶意陷害，致幼子含冤惨死。就在宋景行孤立无援之际，女帝突然现身，当众揭穿宋景行真实身份，原来他竟是帝君，最终女帝严惩恶人，清算孽债。","series_id":"7485657174736112702","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623563272D32AF8F253A6AC3C1A\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7485657174736112702\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7118815779685974,\\\"like\\\":0.04603390023112297,\\\"finish\\\":0.014503581449389458,\\\"collect\\\":0.031143829226493835,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10215643793344498,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.04844990372657776,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1498609781265259}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7485657174736112702","play_cnt":113823,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"山海星辰","sub_title":"古装·虐渣","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":35,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5176,\"name\":\"虐渣\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5176&categoryName=虐渣&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5165,\"name\":\"隐藏大佬\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5165&categoryName=隐藏大佬&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5265,\"name\":\"女帝\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5265&categoryName=女帝&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5339,\"name\":\"古代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5339&categoryName=古代&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"